  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2I26sAXefmk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulevsGitch/BCLib/main/bclib_banner.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111370.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterNether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fquiqueck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/v2/default-yellow.png\" alt=\"Buy Me A Coffee\" width=\"217\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>資源包：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/lum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/285/959/64/64/637302740668770668.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/legendary-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/404/869/64/64/637616146827524233.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>重要事項：</strong></span></p><p>使用 <strong>5.3 或更高版本</strong> 建立的世界的世界 <strong>將與舊版不相容</strong>。當您首次載入由舊版建立的世界時，BCLib 會更新您的世界至最新版本以便遊玩。BCLib 應會自動<strong>建立備份</strong>，但您可能也想手動備份一份。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p><p>有了 BetterNether，您在地獄維度的冒險將更加刺激。此模組為地獄新增了生態域、植物與材料。其中包含具有挑戰性的新怪物（如蛇妖 Naga），以及被地獄生物佔領的黑暗地牢。您的新工具將帶來獨特的改進，幫助您生存。建築玩家將有許多獨特的新方塊，以及熟悉原版方塊的變體。</p><p>本模組在開發過程中特別注意與其他地獄模組和資料包的相容性。如果您遇到任何相容性問題或其他錯誤，請在我們的 <a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterNether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>問題追蹤器</strong></a> 告知我們。</p><p>如果您有任何疑問或需要協助，歡迎加入我們的 <a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://discord.gg/kYuATbYbKW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord 伺服器</strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>數十種地獄新植物</li>\n<li>地獄新生物</li>\n<li>全新的獨特生態域</li>\n<li>垂直與體積生態域系統（支援其他模組與資料包）</li>\n<li>許多新材料、配方、食物、工具與物品</li>\n<li>可透過植物農場與生物農場養殖部分材料</li>\n<li>許多地獄結構，包括巨大且稀有的地獄城市</li>\n<li>可設定方塊、物品、結構、生態域與植物密度的存在（以及配合 ModsMenu 的圖形介面設定）</li>\n<li>與部分其他模組的整合。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>截圖：</strong></strong></span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-5.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29f2/HlDEek3VNtg.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-71.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29a2/GBu5Pq3vBuc.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-49.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29ca/RDxe__idfTw.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-21.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b29ac/M8PjUxu0iDE.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-14.userapi.com/c858532/v858532010/1b2984/etYi_Q48AjM.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://sun9-68.userapi.com/1Evu3p7PqDJ_UFNPPT_6HEHMyFlzrgSDEBhYkg/_hkdd3HTVIc.jpg\" width=\"417\" height=\"221\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>評論：</strong></strong></span></p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MyltKyo_SUI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IJt8EmoNrKY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"221\" width=\"417\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>整合：</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/281/367/64/64/637285257027983134.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/169/440/64/64/636715176146379845.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-hammers\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/204/89/64/64/636937310898607354.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-map\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/250/279/64/64/637177927608665881.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/201/118/64/64/636918075602092560.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-pieces\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/204/17/64/64/636936880683439758.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/canvas-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/197/845/64/64/636895665884150904.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-excavators\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/225/840/64/64/637041832014507122.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>我們的其他模組：</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/471/575/64/64/637760294980874674.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/396/271/64/64/637595638220205053.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/271/438/64/64/637248195374592724.png\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/265/428/64/64/637229325539187031.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eden-ring\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/528/386/64/64/637851066965542722.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wunderreich\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/521/221/64/64/637840028913935424.jpeg\"></a></p>",
